<title>FRANCE: Pathe H1 sales 1.02 billion Ffr.</title>
<headline>Pathe H1 sales 1.02 billion Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>     Turnover				  1,024  vs    898</p>
<p>	 of which second quarter	     490  vs    440</p>
<p>by sector</p>
<p>	 television				 34  vs     65</p>
<p>	 film production and distribution  362  vs    492</p>
<p>	 cinema theatres			 398  vs    341</p>
<p>	 SAIP (Liberation newspaper)	 230  no comparison</p>
<p>NOTE - Media group Pathe published its sales figures in the Official Bulletin (Balo). It said revenues from film production and distribution fell 26 percent from the year-ago period which saw a big success of &quot;The Three Brothers&quot; and &quot;Pedale Douce&quot;.</p>
<p>Sales from cinema theatres rose 17 percent due to increased audiences in the Netherlands and new openings in France in 1996.</p>
<p>Revenues from daily Liberation were consolidated in the accounts from July 1996.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
